{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories: Brenton Lake is a psychological thriller horror game that combines real-life stories with its own unique narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong><u>Dark Memories: Brenton Lake</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an ordinary Christmas season for 19-year-old Ethan, living in Brenton Lake. He would enjoy the holidays with his friends and help his father run the motel. What seemed like just another ordinary day would eventually turn into a nightmare<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.poster.avif?t=1763995643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.webm?t=1763995643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.mp4?t=1763995643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person walking simulator, enriched with exploration,  various interactions, and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.poster.avif?t=1763995643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.webm?t=1763995643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.mp4?t=1763995643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Realistic, atmospheric environment accompanied by retro effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Interactive NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5ed5d1b1caf5eaec2dadf8a3d90bf5c4.poster.avif?t=1763995643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5ed5d1b1caf5eaec2dadf8a3d90bf5c4.webm?t=1763995643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2825740?t=1763995643","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/b48d61c0311d212cec630d3f028b1d40b5f44e64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763995643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/40b4b1a23134e156ed125854f65696995a55da58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763995643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/40b4b1a23134e156ed125854f65696995a55da58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763995643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features objects stained with blood and includes dialogue that contains strong language and profanity, which are integral to the narrative and ambiance of the investigative experience."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories: Brenton Lake is a psychological thriller horror game that combines real-life stories with its own 